<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 88,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 88,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Monday's actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts totaled 88,000 head, compared with the estimate of 95,000.</p>
<p>Opening trade not well established.  Early sales Barrows and Gilts $0.50 per cwt lower compared to midsession Monday.</p>
